  "rules": [
    "CommonMsgDispatcher owns an independent singleton and listener map; ClearEvent replaces it, leaving captured instances usable. SendMessage passes exact args, SendMessageGetKey appends key to a shallow copy only when a listener exists.",
    "Parent counts and child counts are independent; first duplicate child wins. A null child list falls back to parent count, an empty child list does not.",
    "Parent set-zero removes the whole record; reset and unchanged sets still broadcast deltas. Count arithmetic wraps signed64.",
    "Child set itemId0 writes parent count on first record creation only; subsequent child sets create/update child0. Child set does not repair a null dictionary; add and nonzero parent set do.",
    "Record mutation precedes message invocation; exceptions/reentry remain observable. Indexing does not clear prior keys and retains JSON record references.",
    "Message key cache uses signed64 keys but formats Int32 with current culture only on first insertion, never cleared by statistics controller disposal."
  ],
  "pending": [
    "Actual CommonGameModule manager/control/offline ownership and event provider registration",
    "Original gzip persistence, clock anchoring, pool readiness coroutine and daily reset",
    "SevenDay/Activity dependencies and Main composition"
  ],
